    text: "Affected stops:\r\nCoffman St & 6th Ave (#35564) (eastbound)\r\n8th & Coffman PnR Gate F (#35567) (eastbound)\r\nKimbark St & Longs Peak Ave (#25653) (eastbound)\r\nKimbark St & 6th Ave (#14783) (eastbound)\r\nKimbark St & 4th Ave (#33753) (westbound)\r\nKimbark St & 6th Ave (#33754) (westbound)\r\nKimbark St & Longs Peak Ave (#23377) (westbound)\r\nE 9th Ave & Kimbark St (#34214) (westbound)\r\n8th & Coffman PnR Gate C (#17798) (westbound)\r\nCoffman St & 6th Ave (#35563) (westbound)\r\nCoffman St & 4th Ave (#35561) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 323 get on/off buses at:\r\n3rd Ave & Terry St (#11080)\r\n3rd Ave & Collyer St (#26638)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 323 get on/off buses at:\r\n3rd Ave & Collyer St (#26645)\r\n3rd Ave & Coffman St (#11076)"
